  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru Health Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It supports two principal objectives &#x2013; preventing Non-Communicable Diseases (NCDs) and managing outcomes for people with existing NCDs. To effectively address these two objectives, this program aims to strengthen Nauru&#x2019;s health care system and scale-up NCD-related primary health care. This involves facilitating access to necessary drugs and equipment, information and skilled human resources and augmenting Nauru&#x2019;s health management capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
